   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "customData.kind = \"issue\"\n\nThe label is the observation.\nAn agent researches the repo,\ngh opens the issue, and the\nURL lands back on the block.\nThat state is the server's: a\nsync cannot overwrite it, and\na lost one can be adopted back.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind = \"issue\"\n\nThe label is the observation.\nAn agent researches the repo,\ngh opens the issue, and the\nURL lands back on the block.\nThat state is the server's: a\nsync cannot overwrite it, and\na lost one can be adopted back.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
