   "text": "customData.kind = \"project-board\"\n\nThe GitHub project, drawn left\nof the board and never saved: it\nis redrawn from GitHub on every\nread. Alt+B jumps to it. Todo\nreads oldest first, and ↻ on its\nheader fills every free\nimplementation slot from it.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
