   "locked": false,
   "text": "customData.kind = \"terminal\"\n\nShells on the far left, past the\nmirror, as tabs; eight a board.\nDerived: a block lives as long\nas its tabs. Click the screen to\ntype; the header drags it.\n+ / x open, close; ⧉ detach, ⇥\njoin; Alt+T returns; - / + font.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind = \"terminal\"\n\nShells on the far left, past the\nmirror, as tabs; eight a board.\nDerived: a block lives as long\nas its tabs. Click the screen to\ntype; the header drags it.\n+ / x open, close; ⧉ detach, ⇥\njoin; Alt+T returns; - / + font.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
